// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - SCInstructions 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2834926080" "Shadow Shard briefing"
// DetailString :
"P3899535552" "The Shadow Shard was recently discovered while attempting to trace illegal use of the city teleportation grid.  The Shadow Shard is another dimension that exists extremely close to our world; far closer than any other dimension yet discovered, which explains why it had eluded conventional means of detection before now. <br><br>Shortly after it was found, the first explorers found the hostile creatures called the 'Rularuu', who swarmed over Portal Corp security and ran riot in Paragon City until the City's Heroes could bring them under control.  No one knows if the Rularuu are truly intelligent, if they are native to the Shadow Shard, or even if they are one race or many united by something.  No one's even sure if  'Rularuu' is the name of their race, their culture, their religion, or something else, but the Rularuu themselves are fiercely devoted to it. <br><br>The other major shock was the presence of human beings in the shadow shard who claimed to be the descendants of Paragon citizens who had been trapped here after an even they refer to as 'When the madness broke the world'.  Mostly young, they have been hunted by the Rularuu for their entire lives. <br><br>The strange gravity, flying islands, refugees, and weird flora and fauna in the Shadow Shard have made it's exploration and study a top priority.  There are also rumors that several villain groups have taken an interest in the Shadow Shard as well."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P683835502" "I don't know what you've heard about this, {HeroName}, but the researchers at Portal Corp recently broke through to a strange new dimension called the Shadow Shard.  They found floating islands, hostile creatures, and native people who claim to be the descendants of citizens of Paragon City.  There was a major incident there, and now Portal Corp. is working with a special United Nations expeditionary force to investigate Shadow Shard under the command of Brigadier-General Marlon Hammond.  My sources tell me that General Hammond was hoping that as one of Paragon City's most capable and powerful Heroes, you would be willing to <A HREF={ACCEPT}>help the expedition and uncover the mysteries of the Shadow Shard.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1818016615" "Journey to the Shadow Shard to help General Hammond"
// SendOffString :
"P1910405083" "General Hammond will be happy to see you, {HeroName}.  You can find a permanent portal to the Shadow Shard set up in the Portal Corp offices on Peregrine Island."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1526230660" "Talk to General Hammond"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4207337283" "General Hammond has worked with the strange and the unusual before, {HeroName}, but word is that this 'Shadow Shard' has even him worried."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3718180940" "Here's a briefing I got from my sources about the Shadow Shard.  You might want to give it a read."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1526455226" "Welcome to Firebase Zulu, {HeroName}.  I am Brigadier General Marlon Hammond.  I've been placed in charge of security matters here at Zulu and throughout this place.  I've been informed that you've shown some interest in helping us out, and to be frank, we can use any assistance we can get."
